## Deals queue format — /agency/deals-queue.json
{
  "deals": [
    {
      "name": "Product name as shown on Daraz",
      "category": "e.g. Fashion",
      "product_url": "https://www.daraz.com.bd/products/...",
      "affiliate_url": "FULL tracking hyperlink copied from the Daraz affiliate dashboard",
      "price_bdt": "1299  (price as shown on Daraz when added; leave empty if unsure)",
      "note": "optional short note"
    }
  ]
}
n8n posts the FIRST deal whose product_url is not already 'posted' in /agency/deals-log.json, one per day. A failed post is retried the next day (it is not marked posted). To remove a deal, delete it from the queue file. Refresh prices in the queue from time to time — Daraz prices change, and the post must never claim a discount that is not in the entry.
